# Direct dominant cover for 192 rows, floor 12, and 128 bits

The inherited no-gap geometry works unchanged except for cell 95, whose
target-dependent tilt is changed from `13/5` to `19/5`.  Its row caps are the
exact upper endpoints of the existing dyadic interval evaluator.
-/

